,"language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-05-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/71961/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"2023461","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Episodio 37","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Koichi has written a love letter to Buurin. Karin, determined to make Koichi fall in love with her as herself instead, tries to prevent Buurin and Koichi from ever meeting again.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-05-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/71961/season/1/episode/37"},{"id":"2023462","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Episodio 38","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Jimmy sees Buuringo in the sky and, while trying to investigate, falls into another dimension, creating a series of strange circumstances.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-05-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/71961/season/1/episode/38"},{"id":"2023463","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Episodio 39","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Everywhere Buurin appears, one strange mark can be found. Karin and Ton head to Kyoto in order to investigate the connection between the mark and the Mushanokoji family.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-05-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/71961/season/1/episode/39"},{"id":"2023464","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Episodio 40","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kashiwagi's grandmother had the chance to become Buurin as well a long time ago.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-06-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/71961/season/1/episode/40"},{"id":"2023465","seasonNumber":1,"e