emporarily) transform into Cutey Chao! In a strange twist of fate, though, Buurin is needed, and so she has to transform back.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-07-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/71961/season/1/episode/45"},{"id":"2023470","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Episodio 46","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ton and Karin might have to break up their friendship as Karin moves in on her goal of 108 pearls.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-07-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/71961/season/1/episode/46"},{"id":"2023471","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Episodio 47","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Keiko is having a dinner party at her massive, luxurious mansion. It turns out, though, that her parents only come home once a year.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-07-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/71961/season/1/episode/47"},{"id":"2023472","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":48,"title":{"value":"Episodio 48","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"An entrance in a basement leads to another world.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-07-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/71961/season/1/episode/48"},{"id":"2023473","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":49,"title":{"value":"Episodio 49","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Monsters from Keiko's mansion have broken into the outside world, and they're attacking the school. Karin can't find time to transform into Buurin and fears she'll have to do it in front of the others, locking her into Buurin form forever.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1995-08-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.t